WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.201
-Justin and I about to go

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:05.905
head-to-head or face-to-face
in a game of Facebreakers.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.708
Now, we're going to take turns
chipping golf balls

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:11.677
at that wall of glass
with our faces on it.

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:14.613
That is my face.
That is Justin's face.

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:16.716
When we hear this sound...

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.151
[ Air horn blows ]
...that means it's

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.486
the speed round and we'll hit as
many balls as we possibly can.

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:24.124
The first person to break all of
their opponent's faces wins.

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.326
And we're upping the stakes
a bit tonight.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:29.829
FedEx will be donating
$1 million

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.398
to St. Jude's
Children's Research Hospital

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:33.966
in the winner's name!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:36.101 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:36.101 --> 00:00:37.570
How cool is that?!
-Awesome.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.372
-It's my first
high-stakes golf game.

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:40.840
-Yeah.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.544
-Justin, you're my guest.
You're up first.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.013 line:0%
Go on, try to break my face.

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.948 line:0%
-What club we got here?
We got a little 8-iron?

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:49.982 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:51.284 line:0%
Got some tunes. I like it.

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:52.552 line:0%
This is my kind of golfing
right here.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:53.686 line:0%
-I mean, come on.

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:56.056 line:0%
-How hard do I need to
hit this thing?

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.425 line:0%
Oh! Oh! Fore!

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:01.094 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:03.429 line:0%
-It's -- It's Facebreakers!

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:04.930 line:0%
-I thought I was supposed to
actually try to break your face.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:07.833 line:0%
-Good Lord. Oh, my gosh,
you literally almost broke

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:11.004 line:0%
my actual something.
All right.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:13.006 line:0%
-I feel like I should
cover up over here.

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:17.410 line:0%
-Here we go.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.611 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.179 line:0%
Ooh! From behind,
that would have been awesome.

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:22.682 line:0%
Yeah, all right.
All right, you're up, buddy.

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:25.184 line:0%
-Well, you got me all nervous
after that last one.

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:27.152 line:0%
-Got<i> me</i> nervous?
Please.

00:01:27.152 --> 00:01:29.789 line:0%
You're shaking right now, dude.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.025 line:0%
-Oh!
-What's your problem, dude?

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:34.294 line:0%
Watch.
Let me show you how it's done.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:36.829 line:0%
It's so easy, Justin.
Go like this. Watch.

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:38.531 line:0%
[ Air horn blows ]

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:39.898 line:0%
-Rapid fire?
-Wait. All right, rapid fire.

00:01:39.898 --> 00:01:41.000 line:0%
Here you go.
[ Air horn blows ]

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.435 line:0%
Here's the horn. Go for it!

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:43.770 line:0%
-Go, Jimmy!

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.772 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:49.375 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.312 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:55.281 line:0%
-Oh, look out! Fore!

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:59.985 line:0%
Fore!

00:01:59.985 --> 00:02:02.755 line:0%
Oh, my God. [ Laughs ]

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:03.789 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:05.591 line:0%
-I win!

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:07.593 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:07.593 --> 00:02:11.864
-The champ!
The champion right there!

00:02:11.864 --> 00:02:13.566
-I'm good at this game.

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:17.036
-That means FedEx
will be donating $1 million

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:20.072
to St. Jude's
Children's Research Hospital

00:02:20.072 --> 00:02:22.207
in Justin Thomas's name.

00:02:22.207 --> 00:02:25.277
Justin Thomas, everybody!

00:02:25.277 --> 00:02:27.146
Form was awful.

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:30.950
Check him out in the FedEx cup
playoffs starting August 23rd.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.853
We'll be right back with
stand-up from Dusty Slay!

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:35.588
Stick around.

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.757
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:40.426 line:0%
♪♪

